{"letters":[{"upper":"A","lower":"a","nameZh":"诶","sound":"/eɪ/，在单词里常是 /æ/","tip":"字母名叫「诶」。apple 里嘴张大，发短音 /æ/。","example":"apple","exampleZh":"苹果"},{"upper":"B","lower":"b","nameZh":"比","sound":"/b/","tip":"双唇闭上再轻轻张开，喉咙要振动。","example":"book","exampleZh":"书"},{"upper":"C","lower":"c","nameZh":"西","sound":"/k/ 或 /s/","tip":"cat 里发 /k/，city 里发 /s/。先记 /k/。","example":"cat","exampleZh":"猫"},{"upper":"D","lower":"d","nameZh":"地","sound":"/d/","tip":"舌尖点一下上齿后面，声带振动。","example":"door","exampleZh":"门"},{"upper":"E","lower":"e","nameZh":"伊","sound":"/iː/ 或 /e/","tip":"名字是「伊」。see 里拉长，bed 里又短又松。","example":"see","exampleZh":"看见"},{"upper":"F","lower":"f","nameZh":"艾夫","sound":"/f/","tip":"上齿轻咬下唇，只出气，喉咙不震。","example":"fish","exampleZh":"鱼"},{"upper":"G","lower":"g","nameZh":"吉","sound":"/ɡ/ 或 /dʒ/","tip":"go 里发 /ɡ/。后面若是 e 或 i，常发 /dʒ/，像 page。","example":"go","exampleZh":"去"},{"upper":"H","lower":"h","nameZh":"诶吃","sound":"/h/","tip":"轻轻哈一口气，不要发成中文「喝」那么重。","example":"he","exampleZh":"他"},{"upper":"I","lower":"i","nameZh":"艾","sound":"/aɪ/ 或 /ɪ/","tip":"名字是「艾」。hi 用这个长音，it 用短而松的 /ɪ/。","example":"hi","exampleZh":"嗨"},{"upper":"J","lower":"j","nameZh":"杰","sound":"/dʒ/","tip":"舌尖先挡住气，再挤出去。不是中文「居」。","example":"juice","exampleZh":"果汁"},{"upper":"K","lower":"k","nameZh":"kei","sound":"/k/","tip":"舌根顶一下再送气，喉咙不震。","example":"key","exampleZh":"钥匙"},{"upper":"L","lower":"l","nameZh":"艾欧","sound":"/l/","tip":"舌尖抵住上齿龈，气从舌头两边走。","example":"like","exampleZh":"喜欢"},{"upper":"M","lower":"m","nameZh":"艾姆","sound":"/m/","tip":"双唇合上，让声音从鼻子出来。","example":"my","exampleZh":"我的"},{"upper":"N","lower":"n","nameZh":"恩","sound":"/n/","tip":"舌尖顶住上齿龈，声音走鼻子。","example":"name","exampleZh":"名字"},{"upper":"O","lower":"o","nameZh":"欧","sound":"/oʊ/ 或 /ɑ/","tip":"名字是圆唇的「欧」。home 会从 o 滑向 u。","example":"home","exampleZh":"家"},{"upper":"P","lower":"p","nameZh":"批","sound":"/p/","tip":"双唇爆破，只出气。和 b 的差别是喉咙不震。","example":"pen","exampleZh":"笔"},{"upper":"Q","lower":"q","nameZh":"克尤","sound":"/kw/","tip":"几乎总是写成 qu，读成 /kw/，像 queen。","example":"queen","exampleZh":"女王"},{"upper":"R","lower":"r","nameZh":"啊","sound":"/r/","tip":"嘴微圆，舌头不要卷成中文的「日」。","example":"red","exampleZh":"红色"},{"upper":"S","lower":"s","nameZh":"艾斯","sound":"/s/","tip":"气流从牙缝里出去，像很轻的「丝」。","example":"see","exampleZh":"看见"},{"upper":"T","lower":"t","nameZh":"提","sound":"/t/","tip":"舌尖点一下再送气。和 d 相比喉咙不震。","example":"tea","exampleZh":"茶"},{"upper":"U","lower":"u","nameZh":"优","sound":"/juː/ 或 /ʌ/","tip":"名字是「优」。you 走这个音，cup 则又短又松。","example":"you","exampleZh":"你"},{"upper":"V","lower":"v","nameZh":"维","sound":"/v/","tip":"上齿咬下唇，而且喉咙要震。这是 f 的浊音。","example":"very","exampleZh":"非常"},{"upper":"W","lower":"w","nameZh":"达布尤","sound":"/w/","tip":"先圆唇，再迅速打开。water 的开头就是它。","example":"water","exampleZh":"水"},{"upper":"X","lower":"x","nameZh":"埃克斯","sound":"/ks/","tip":"多数时候发 /ks/，像 box 的尾巴。","example":"box","exampleZh":"盒子"},{"upper":"Y","lower":"y","nameZh":"外","sound":"/j/ 或 /aɪ/","tip":"在 yes 开头发 /j/。单独一个词 why 里更像 /aɪ/。","example":"yes","exampleZh":"是的"},{"upper":"Z","lower":"z","nameZh":"兹","sound":"/z/","tip":"嘴型和 s 一样，但声带要振动。","example":"zoo","exampleZh":"动物园"}],"phonemes":[{"id":"iy","symbol":"iː","group":"vowel","title":"长衣音","mouth":"嘴角向两边拉，像轻微笑，声音拉长。","tip":"中文「衣」很接近，但更靠前、更平。","examples":[{"en":"see","zh":"看见"},{"en":"sheep","zh":"羊"},{"en":"tea","zh":"茶"}]},{"id":"ih","symbol":"ɪ","group":"vowel","title":"短松衣","mouth":"嘴比 iː 松一点，声音短，马上停。","tip":"ship 和 sheep 的差别就在这里：短的是船，长的是羊。","examples":[{"en":"ship","zh":"船"},{"en":"it","zh":"它"},{"en":"big","zh":"大"}]},{"id":"eh","symbol":"e","group":"vowel","title":"半开诶","mouth":"嘴半开，舌尖抵下齿，短促。","tip":"比「诶」嘴张得稍大，不要拉长。","examples":[{"en":"bed","zh":"床"},{"en":"pen","zh":"笔"},{"en":"yes","zh":"是"}]},{"id":"ae","symbol":"æ","group":"vowel","title":"大嘴哎","mouth":"嘴张大，能看见舌头，短而亮。","tip":"apple、cat、happy 都是它。中国学习者最容易把它读成「哎」太窄。","examples":[{"en":"apple","zh":"苹果"},{"en":"cat","zh":"猫"},{"en":"bag","zh":"包"}]},{"id":"ah","symbol":"ɑ","group":"vowel","title":"张口啊","mouth":"嘴巴张大，舌头放平放后。","tip":"美音里 hot、not、father 常是这个音。","examples":[{"en":"hot","zh":"热"},{"en":"not","zh":"不"},{"en":"father","zh":"父亲"}]},{"id":"aw","symbol":"ɔ","group":"vowel","title":"圆唇奥","mouth":"嘴唇收圆，嘴不要张到最大。","tip":"morning、door 里都能感到这个圆唇。","examples":[{"en":"door","zh":"门"},{"en":"morning","zh":"早上"},{"en":"talk","zh":"说话"}]},{"id":"uh","symbol":"ʊ","group":"vowel","title":"短乌","mouth":"嘴唇稍圆，很短，不要往前嘟。","tip":"good、book、look 是一家的。不要读成「古」那么长。","examples":[{"en":"good","zh":"好"},{"en":"book","zh":"书"},{"en":"look","zh":"看"}]},{"id":"uw","symbol":"uː","group":"vowel","title":"长乌","mouth":"嘴唇收圆并稍向前，声音拉长。","tip":"food、you、two 拉得比 good 长一倍。","examples":[{"en":"food","zh":"食物"},{"en":"you","zh":"你"},{"en":"two","zh":"二"}]},{"id":"ah2","symbol":"ʌ","group":"vowel","title":"短啊","mouth":"嘴微张，下巴放松，声音又短又钝。","tip":"cup、love、come 都是。它不是「啊」那么开。","examples":[{"en":"cup","zh":"杯子"},{"en":"love","zh":"爱"},{"en":"come","zh":"来"}]},{"id":"er","symbol":"ɝ","group":"vowel","title":"卷舌尔","mouth":"舌中部略抬，带一点美音的 r，但不要抖动。","tip":"bird、word、work 的元音就是它。","examples":[{"en":"bird","zh":"鸟"},{"en":"word","zh":"单词"},{"en":"work","zh":"工作"}]},{"id":"schwa","symbol":"ə","group":"vowel","title":"轻声呃","mouth":"嘴几乎不动，又轻又短。","tip":"英文里最常见。about 的 a、problem 的末尾，都常常是它。","examples":[{"en":"about","zh":"关于"},{"en":"the","zh":"那个"},{"en":"problem","zh":"问题"}]},{"id":"ey","symbol":"eɪ","group":"glide","title":"诶移","mouth":"从「诶」滑向「衣」，像 day。","tip":"name、they、day 都在滑动，不要读成单一的「诶」。","examples":[{"en":"day","zh":"天"},{"en":"name","zh":"名字"},{"en":"they","zh":"他们"}]},{"id":"ay","symbol":"aɪ","group":"glide","title":"啊移","mouth":"从张口滑向「衣」。","tip":"这就是 hi、my、I 的元音。你已经会了。","examples":[{"en":"hi","zh":"嗨"},{"en":"my","zh":"我的"},{"en":"time","zh":"时间"}]},{"id":"oy","symbol":"ɔɪ","group":"glide","title":"奥移","mouth":"先圆唇，再滑向「衣」。","tip":"boy 的元音。圆唇要做出来。","examples":[{"en":"boy","zh":"男孩"},{"en":"toy","zh":"玩具"}]},{"id":"aw2","symbol":"aʊ","group":"glide","title":"啊乌","mouth":"从张口收到圆唇。","tip":"now、how、out。结尾要把嘴唇收圆。","examples":[{"en":"now","zh":"现在"},{"en":"how","zh":"怎么"},{"en":"out","zh":"出去"}]},{"id":"ow","symbol":"oʊ","group":"glide","title":"欧乌","mouth":"从圆唇 o 再收得更圆。","tip":"go、home、no。不要读成中文单韵母「欧」就停住。","examples":[{"en":"go","zh":"去"},{"en":"home","zh":"家"},{"en":"no","zh":"不"}]},{"id":"p","symbol":"p","group":"consonant","title":"清双唇","mouth":"双唇紧闭再张开，只有气，喉咙不震。","tip":"手摸喉咙：p 不震，b 会震。","examples":[{"en":"pen","zh":"笔"},{"en":"please","zh":"请"}]},{"id":"b","symbol":"b","group":"consonant","title":"浊双唇","mouth":"嘴型和 p 一样，但声带振动。","tip":"book 的开头比 pen 更「实」。","examples":[{"en":"book","zh":"书"},{"en":"bye","zh":"再见"}]},{"id":"t","symbol":"t","group":"consonant","title":"清舌尖","mouth":"舌尖点上齿龈，送气。","tip":"tea、time。词尾常常很轻。","examples":[{"en":"tea","zh":"茶"},{"en":"time","zh":"时间"}]},{"id":"d","symbol":"d","group":"consonant","title":"浊舌尖","mouth":"位置像 t，喉咙要震。","tip":"day、door。","examples":[{"en":"day","zh":"天"},{"en":"door","zh":"门"}]},{"id":"k","symbol":"k","group":"consonant","title":"清舌根","mouth":"舌根抬起再放开，送气。","tip":"can、cat 开头。","examples":[{"en":"can","zh":"能"},{"en":"cat","zh":"猫"}]},{"id":"g","symbol":"g","group":"consonant","title":"浊舌根","mouth":"位置像 k，声带振动。","tip":"go、good。不要发成中文「哥」那么重的元音。","examples":[{"en":"go","zh":"去"},{"en":"good","zh":"好"}]},{"id":"f","symbol":"f","group":"consonant","title":"轻咬唇","mouth":"上齿轻碰下唇，只出气。","tip":"for、friend。","examples":[{"en":"for","zh":"为了"},{"en":"friend","zh":"朋友"}]},{"id":"v","symbol":"v","group":"consonant","title":"浊咬唇","mouth":"同样咬唇，但喉咙震。","tip":"中文没有这个音。very 不要读成「外瑞」。","examples":[{"en":"very","zh":"非常"},{"en":"love","zh":"爱"}]},{"id":"th","symbol":"θ","group":"consonant","title":"咬舌清音","mouth":"舌尖轻轻伸出牙外，吹气，不振动。","tip":"thank、three。不要用 s 代替，也不要咬得太用力。","examples":[{"en":"thank","zh":"谢谢"},{"en":"three","zh":"三"}]},{"id":"dh","symbol":"ð","group":"consonant","title":"咬舌浊音","mouth":"舌尖同样轻伸，但声带振动。","tip":"this、that、the 全是它。比 θ 更响。","examples":[{"en":"this","zh":"这个"},{"en":"they","zh":"他们"}]},{"id":"s","symbol":"s","group":"consonant","title":"清丝","mouth":"气流从牙缝过，不振动。","tip":"see、sorry。","examples":[{"en":"see","zh":"看见"},{"en":"sorry","zh":"对不起"}]},{"id":"z","symbol":"z","group":"consonant","title":"浊丝","mouth":"嘴型同 s，声带振动。","tip":"zoo、is 里的 s 其实常读 /z/。","examples":[{"en":"zoo","zh":"动物园"},{"en":"is","zh":"是"}]},{"id":"sh","symbol":"ʃ","group":"consonant","title":"嘘","mouth":"嘴唇稍圆，舌面抬起，像让人安静。","tip":"she、share。比 s 更厚。","examples":[{"en":"she","zh":"她"},{"en":"share","zh":"分享"}]},{"id":"zh","symbol":"ʒ","group":"consonant","title":"浊嘘","mouth":"嘴型同 ʃ，声带振动。","tip":"通常出现在词中，如 usually、vision。","examples":[{"en":"usually","zh":"通常"},{"en":"vision","zh":"视力"}]},{"id":"ch","symbol":"tʃ","group":"consonant","title":"吃","mouth":"先用舌尖挡住，再发 ʃ。","tip":"watch、chair。是 t 加 ʃ 粘在一起。","examples":[{"en":"watch","zh":"注视"},{"en":"chair","zh":"椅子"}]},{"id":"dj","symbol":"dʒ","group":"consonant","title":"居","mouth":"先挡住再放开，声带振动。","tip":"job、juice。J 这个字母多数发它。","examples":[{"en":"juice","zh":"果汁"},{"en":"job","zh":"工作"}]},{"id":"h","symbol":"h","group":"consonant","title":"哈气","mouth":"口腔打开，轻轻送气。","tip":"he、home、hi 的 h 很轻。","examples":[{"en":"he","zh":"他"},{"en":"home","zh":"家"}]},{"id":"m","symbol":"m","group":"consonant","title":"闭唇鼻音","mouth":"双唇闭合，声音走鼻子。","tip":"my、morning 的 m。","examples":[{"en":"my","zh":"我的"},{"en":"morning","zh":"早上"}]},{"id":"n","symbol":"n","group":"consonant","title":"舌尖鼻音","mouth":"舌尖顶上齿龈。","tip":"name、night。","examples":[{"en":"name","zh":"名字"},{"en":"night","zh":"夜晚"}]},{"id":"ng","symbol":"ŋ","group":"consonant","title":"舌根鼻音","mouth":"舌根抬起，气从鼻子走，不要加一个硬 g。","tip":"morning 的尾巴、sing。不是「英格」。","examples":[{"en":"sing","zh":"唱"},{"en":"morning","zh":"早上"}]},{"id":"l","symbol":"l","group":"consonant","title":"边音","mouth":"舌尖抵住上齿龈，气从两边出。","tip":"like、look。不要发成 r。","examples":[{"en":"like","zh":"喜欢"},{"en":"look","zh":"看"}]},{"id":"r","symbol":"r","group":"consonant","title":"近音 r","mouth":"嘴唇略圆，舌尖悬空，不打颤。","tip":"red、read。别卷成中文「日」。","examples":[{"en":"red","zh":"红色"},{"en":"read","zh":"读"}]},{"id":"w","symbol":"w","group":"consonant","title":"圆唇滑音","mouth":"先圆唇再打开。","tip":"we、water、one。one 虽然写 o，读 /wʌn/。","examples":[{"en":"we","zh":"我们"},{"en":"water","zh":"水"}]},{"id":"y","symbol":"j","group":"consonant","title":"耶滑音","mouth":"舌面抬向硬腭，很快滑开。","tip":"yes、you。很像中文「耶」的开头。","examples":[{"en":"yes","zh":"是"},{"en":"you","zh":"你"}]}],"groups":[{"id":"vowel","label":"元音"},{"id":"glide","label":"双元音"},{"id":"consonant","label":"辅音"}],"pairs":[{"id":"sheep-ship","tip":"羊的元音拉长并微笑；船又短又松。","a":{"en":"sheep","ipa":"iː","zh":"羊"},"b":{"en":"ship","ipa":"ɪ","zh":"船"}},{"id":"bed-bad","tip":"bed 嘴半开；bad 嘴张得更大。","a":{"en":"bed","ipa":"e","zh":"床"},"b":{"en":"bad","ipa":"æ","zh":"坏"}},{"id":"book-boot","tip":"book 短而松；boot 又圆又长。","a":{"en":"book","ipa":"ʊ","zh":"书"},"b":{"en":"boot","ipa":"uː","zh":"靴子"}},{"id":"think-sink","tip":"think 要伸出舌尖；sink 只是牙缝的 s。","a":{"en":"think","ipa":"θ","zh":"想"},"b":{"en":"sink","ipa":"s","zh":"水槽"}},{"id":"they-day","tip":"they 舌尖轻咬并振动；day 是舌尖爆破。","a":{"en":"they","ipa":"ð","zh":"他们"},"b":{"en":"day","ipa":"d","zh":"天"}},{"id":"right-light","tip":"right 舌尖悬空；light 舌尖抵住上齿龈。","a":{"en":"right","ipa":"r","zh":"对"},"b":{"en":"light","ipa":"l","zh":"光"}},{"id":"vest-west","tip":"vest 上齿咬下唇；west 只圆唇，牙齿不咬。","a":{"en":"vest","ipa":"v","zh":"背心"},"b":{"en":"west","ipa":"w","zh":"西"}},{"id":"cup-cap","tip":"cup 嘴微张又短；cap 嘴张大。","a":{"en":"cup","ipa":"ʌ","zh":"杯子"},"b":{"en":"cap","ipa":"æ","zh":"帽子"}}],"scenes":[{"id":"morning","title":"早上见面","pack":"starter","intro":"把你已经会的四个词放进同一个早上。","lines":[{"prompt":"Good ____.","zh":"早上好。","answer":"morning","wordId":"morning"},{"prompt":"____, my friend.","zh":"嗨，我的朋友。","answer":"Hi","wordId":"hi"},{"prompt":"This is ____ book.","zh":"这是我的书。","answer":"my","wordId":"my"},{"prompt":"Have a ____ day.","zh":"祝你有美好的一天。","answer":"good","wordId":"good"}]},{"id":"home","title":"回到家","pack":"starter","intro":"开门、喝水、看见自己的书。","lines":[{"prompt":"I go ____.","zh":"我回家。","answer":"home","wordId":"home"},{"prompt":"____ the door.","zh":"打开门。"